        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa\n- Places: Nayarit, Mexico\n- Infrastructure: a waterway, a dam\n- Waterways: The Mololoa River\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa served as President of Mexico from 2006 to 2012.\n- A dam on the waterway was completed in 2012.\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa inaugurated the dam in 2012.\n- The waterway is one of the biggest in Nayarit, Mexico.\n- The Mololoa River is also one of the biggest waterways in Nayarit, Mexico.",
